  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n** (P)/(3)=(Q)/(5)=(R)/(2)**\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n (P)/(3)=(Q)/(5)\n\n⇒ (P)/(Q)=(3)/(5)\n\nSo, P : Q = 3 : 5\n\nAgain,\n\n (P)/(3)=(R)/(2)\n\n⇒ (P)/(R)=(3)/(2)\n\nSo, P : R = 3 : 2\n\nAgain,\n\n (Q)/(5)=(R)/(2)\n\n⇒ (Q)/(R)=(5)/(2)\n\nSo, Q : R = 5 : 2\n\nSo, P : Q : R = 3 : 5 : 2\n\nNow,\n\n(P + 2Q + 3R) ∶ (P + Q + R) = (3 + 10 + 6) : (3 + 5 + 2)\n\n⇒ 19 : 10\n\n**∴ The required answer is 19 : 10.**",
